- no FinalOutput creation
- no action permission
- no direct reuse permission
- no manifest mutation
- no transition matrix mutation
- no Marennya/UP
- no public WOW
- no whitepaper/public auditor packet
- Real Semantic Runtime MVP is not complete

Authority boundary conclusion:

Bounded LLM/SLM Actors v0.1 defines deterministic actor contracts and target
boundary validation for Intake, Orchestrator, Architect, Executor, Verifier/Post
V&V, GT boundary, and Root return. Actor outputs, LLM/SLM outputs, model
confidence, tool capability, route proposals, PlanGraph proposals, ResultProposal
artifacts, validation reports, and GT reports remain bounded. The layer does not
create a new execution engine, does not activate live model paths, does not
change Root behavior, and does not create final authority below Root. Root
remains final authority.
